### Review Case Flag

The following case flags have been added to the case:

<ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
  {% for flag in flags %}
  <li class="govuk-!-font-size-19">{{flag}}</li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>

Review the case flags on the <a href="/cases/case-details/PCS/PCS/{{caseReference}}#Case%20flags">case flags tab</a>,
check whether any action is required, and take the appropriate action. Only mark the task as complete once the case
flags have been reviewed and any required action has been completed.
